@startuml
left to right direction

title Use Case Diagram for AI-Powered Analysis & Insights System

rectangle "System" {
  usecase "CFR001: View Financial Insights Dashboard" as CFR001
  usecase "SAFR002: Manage Anomaly Detection Parameters" as SAFR002
  usecase "FAFR005: Schedule Client Mentoring Sessions" as FAFR005
  usecase "CFR003: View Financial Predictions" as CFR003
  usecase "SAFR004: Adjust Analysis Parameters for Segments" as SAFR004
  usecase "SFR012: Generate Client Dashboards" as SFR012
  usecase "CFR007: View Investment Opportunities" as CFR007
  usecase "SAFR003: Manage Notification Channels for Alerts" as SAFR003
  usecase "SFR008: Request Investment Opportunity Analysis" as SFR008
  usecase "CFR010: Share Financial Data with Advisors" as CFR010

  Client --> CFR001 : View financial data and insights.
  Client --> SAFR002 : Manage anomaly detection thresholds (FATF).
  Client --> FAFR005 : Schedule mentoring sessions based on system-generated insights.
  Client --> CFR003 : Access future predictions using historical data and market trends.
  Client --> SAFR004 : Customize analysis parameters for specific segments.
  Client --> SFR012 : View consolidated financial information in a single dashboard.
  Client --> CFR007 : Explore investment opportunities aligned with risk profile (MiFID II).
  Client --> SAFR003 : Adjust alert notification preferences.
  Client --> SFR008 : Request specific investments matching criteria and ESG factors.
  Client --> SAFR001: Manage system parameters for accuracy, relevance, and compliance (Basel III).
  
  SysAdmin --> CFR002 : Set up alerts for clients based on transactional data.
  SysAdmin --> SFR009 : Request contextualized news related to investments.
  SysAdmin --> AIFR001: Manage AI-generated financial predictions.
  SysAdmin --> AIFR008: Schedule predictive intervention analyses.

  FinancialAdvisor --> FAFR002 : Plan client mentoring sessions using system insights.
  FinancialAdvisor --> FAFR003 : View alerts for clients needing immediate attention.
  FinancialAdvisor --> SFR014: Review financial health reports to track progress.
  
  System --> AIFR006: Trigger spending limit alerts when thresholds are exceeded (AML).
  System --> AIFR007: Provide contextualized news insights based on portfolio relevance.
  System --> SAFR005: Manage client dashboards for intuitive presentation of data.
}

@enduml